<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE .</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE .</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Almost all Helibor interest</p>
<p>rates rose at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate rose three basis points to 3.10 percent.</p>
<p>			 January 27 fix	January 24 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	  3.03 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	  3.06 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	  3.10 pct		3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	  3.20 pct		3.14 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	  3.28 pct		3.21 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	 3.38 pct		3.31 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
